# Tuffy 公開入口。此檔案是站點專屬設定，已由 .gitignore 排除。
# 各應用程式的內部健康狀態由 http-services.internal.yml 直接探測。
- targets: ["https://www.tuffy-lin.com/healthz"]
  labels:
    service: tuffy-public-edge
    role: public-web

# Nginx 公開子路由；使用不需登入或可接受登入轉址的入口，觀察 proxy 路由本身。
- targets: ["https://www.tuffy-lin.com/"]
  labels:
    service: tuffy-home
    role: public-web

- targets: ["https://www.tuffy-lin.com/grafana/api/health"]
  labels:
    service: tuffy-grafana
    role: public-web

- targets: ["https://www.tuffy-lin.com/file/"]
  labels:
    service: tuffy-file
    role: public-web

- targets: ["https://www.tuffy-lin.com/resume/"]
  labels:
    service: tuffy-resume
    role: public-web

- targets: ["https://www.tuffy-lin.com/tuffy_stock/"]
  labels:
    service: tuffy-stock
    role: public-web

- targets: ["https://www.tuffy-lin.com/2026-xmas/"]
  labels:
    service: tuffy-xmas
    role: public-web
